<title>CHINA: China Jan-May pork exports down 64.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May pork exports down 64.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 20,000 tonnes of pork in January-May, down 64.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-MAY    MAY	  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Pork     20,000	  10,000		 -64.6</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
